{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带及少量车体；远处机枪阻断接近")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("四人突击班，以柄式手榴弹清理近处守军，也能损伤坦克履带。用烟幕或机枪掩护接近，避免暴露在远处机枪的火力下。")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Four assault troops use stick grenades against nearby defenders and tank tracks. Cover their approach with smoke or machine guns; distant guns can stop them in the open.")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("柄式手榴弹先落进敌壕。\n四人突击班，擅长近壕交战，也能损伤履带。烟幕掩护接近；远处机枪是主要威胁。")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Stick grenades lead the assault into the trench.\nFour men excel at close fighting and can damage tracks. Smoke covers the approach; distant machine guns are a serious threat.")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("柄式手榴弹先越过胸墙。突击班擅长近壕交战，也能威胁履带；接近途中需要烟幕或机枪掩护。\n编制：4人。")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Stick grenades cross the parapet first. Assault men excel in close trenches and can threaten tracks; smoke or covering fire helps them survive the approach.\nSection: 4 men.")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。\n四人突击小队；接近敌壕后投弹\n手雷损伤履带，并对车体造成少量损伤；远处机枪阻断接近"),TEXT("Stick grenades clear the parapet; the assault party follows.\nFour men; close on the trench before throwing\nGrenades damage tracks and slightly damage hulls; distant guns check the approach"),TEXT("Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close.")},

// S.0 - Match the English breech action with concrete Chinese component/action.
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("电话线接通，炮兵复诵方位。\n多轮炮火覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位与集结部队。传令延迟和散布使移动目标较难命中；友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the telephone.\nSeveral salvos strike the selected area, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets; friendly troops are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("电话那端，炮长复诵方位。野炮以多轮爆炸覆盖指定地段；传令延迟和散布使移动目标更难命中。\n落弹区内的友军同样受伤。")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("At the other end of the wire, the battery repeats the bearing. Several salvos cover the chosen ground; delay and scatter make moving targets harder to hit.\nFriendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"),TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed.")},

// ARMOUR.MarkV - English grammar/control terminology; match the authored Chinese hull protection.
{TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。\n操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。"),TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.\nA cannon tank with improved controls and stronger hull protection. Two cannon break resistance; its readiness remains longer than the older Mark IV."),TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。\n操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。")},
{TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。\n操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。"),TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.\nA cannon tank with improved controls and stronger hull protection. Two cannon break resistance; its readiness remains longer than the older Mark IV."),TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.\nA heavier protected gun tank with improved control. Two cannon break resistance; its readiness remains longer than the older Mark IV.")},
